{"comment_text": {"ja54:0.1": "", "ja54:0.2": "", "ja54:0.3": "", "ja54:0.4": "", "ja54:1.1": "A tree is laden with fruit that looks like mango, but the wide caravan leader deduces that it must be the poisonous “what-fruit” (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>kiṁphala</i>). ", "ja54:1.2": "", "ja54:1.3": "", "ja54:1.4": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Duma</i> (“tree”) specially indicates a “flowering tree”. ", "ja54:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja54:0.1": "<article id='ja54'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja54:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja54:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja54:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja54:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja54:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja54:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja54:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja54:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja54:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja54:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja54:0.3": "Āsīsavagga ", "ja54:0.4": "4. Kiṁphalajātaka ", "ja54:1.1": "“Nāyaṁ rukkho durāruho, ", "ja54:1.2": "napi gāmato ārakā; ", "ja54:1.3": "Ākāraṇena jānāmi, ", "ja54:1.4": "nāyaṁ sāduphalo dumo”ti. ", "ja54:2.1": "Kiṁphalajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja54:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 54 ", "ja54:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja54:0.3": "Hope ", "ja54:0.4": "The What-fruit: a past life story ", "ja54:1.1": "This tree is not hard to climb, ", "ja54:1.2": "nor is it far from the village. ", "ja54:1.3": "For this reason I know ", "ja54:1.4": "this tree is not sweet-fruited. ", "ja54:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja54:0.1": "", "ja54:0.2": "", "ja54:0.3": "", "ja54:0.4": "", "ja54:1.1": "", "ja54:1.2": "", "ja54:1.3": "", "ja54:1.4": "", "ja54:2.1": "Kiṁphalajātakaṁ → phalajātakaṁ (si, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja54:0.1": "", "ja54:0.2": "", "ja54:0.3": "", "ja54:0.4": "", "ja54:1.1": "dr27.19, ms22J_119, msdiv54, pts-vp-pli1.272, sya27.18", "ja54:1.2": "", "ja54:1.3": "", "ja54:1.4": "", "ja54:2.1": "ms22J_120"}, "keys_order": ["ja54:0.1", "ja54:0.2", "ja54:0.3", "ja54:0.4", "ja54:1.1", "ja54:1.2", "ja54:1.3", "ja54:1.4", "ja54:2.1"]}